,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in: 4.4.1, master\n- Not reproducible: 4.3\n\n`git bisect` shows this regression happened in: 25cd923ea15317451c7d9f271fb364487ef3b101 #100694\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.4.1.stable.mono - Windows 10 (build 19045) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3050 Laptop GPU (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.8115) - AMD Ryzen 7 5800H with Radeon Graphics (16 threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nDeleting a `TreeItem` in the `cell_selected` signal sometimes causes a crash of the entire engine without leaving any trace in the log or debugger. Starting godot from the cli the only error is:\n```\nERROR: FATAL: Index p_index = 3 is out of bounds (((Vector<T> *)(this))->_cowdata.size() = 0).\n   at: VectorWriteProxy<struct TreeItem::Cell>::operator [] (.\\core/templates/vector.h:54)\n```\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nCreate a tree, populate a root node with two children, in the `cell_selected` signal; call `.free` on the index 0 child.\nAs long as there are siblings after the deleted node the engine will crash without any error message to the user.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nHere is a repro that populates a `Tree` with a root node and two children. Clicking the child marked \"click me\" crashes the engine.\n[TreeItemCrashRepro.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/22344123/TreeItemCrashRepro.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"NogginBops","id":3778357,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM3NzgzNTc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3778357?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NogginBops","html_url":"https://github.com/NogginBops","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NogginBops/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NogginBops/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NogginBops/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NogginBops/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NogginBops/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NogginBops/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NogginBops/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NogginBops/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NogginBops/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110531/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110531/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}